ed of 1280x720.\n\nIs the problem on your setup caused by ignoring bytesperline setting?\nHave you tried latest version of DroidCam?\nI've checked variety of webcams and all of them did not used extra padding but I assume that it's worth of supporting it to be on safe side.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4968893251/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4973483191","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119851#issuecomment-4973483191","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119851","id":4973483191,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABKHFUtw","user":{"login":"shiena","id":1295639,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyOTU2Mzk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1295639?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena","html_url":"https://github.com/shiena","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-14T20:04:58Z","updated_at":"2026-07-14T20:04:58Z","body":"I am using DroidCam(Classic) 2.1.5, and the device information is as follows:\n\n```\nDriver Info:\n        Driver name      : Droidcam\n        Card type        : Droidcam\n        Bus info         : platform:v4l2loopback_dc-000\n        Driver version   : 6.16.12\n        Capabilities     : 0x85200001\n                Video Capture\n                Read/Write\n                Streaming\n                Extended Pix Format\n                Device Capabilities\n        Device Caps      : 0x85200001\n                Video Capture\n                Read/Write\n                Streaming\n                Extended Pix Format\n                Device Capabilities\nioctl: VIDIOC_ENUM_FMT\n        Type: Video Capture\n\n        [0]: 'YU12' (Planar YUV 4:2:0)\n```\n\nThe difference between your setup and mine is YU12 versus YUYV.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4973483191/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4974386782","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119851#issuecomment-4974386782","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119851","id":4974386782,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABKH8eXg","user":{"login":"pkowal1982","id":19764492,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NzY0NDky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19764492?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pkowal1982","html_url":"https://github.com/pkowal1982","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pkowal1982/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pkowal1982/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pkowal1982/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pkowal1982/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pkowal1982/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pkowal1982/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pkowal1982/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pkowal1982/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pkowal1982/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-14T21:59:49Z","updated_at":"2026-07-14T21:59:49Z","body":"What resolutions are supported? Could you also check to what value bytesperplane is set to? I would assume it is equal to width.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4974386782/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4974443065","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119851#issuecomment-4974443065","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119851","id":4974443065,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABKH_6OQ","user":{"login":"shiena","id":1295639,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyOTU2Mzk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1295639?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena","html_url":"https://github.com/shiena","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-14T22:08:01Z","updated_at":"2026-07-15T03:08:01Z","body":"```\n$ v4l2-ctl -d /dev/video0 -V\nFormat Video Capture:\n        Width/Height      : 1280/720\n        Pixel Format      : 'YU12' (Planar YUV 4:2:0)\n        Field             : None\n        Bytes per Line    : 1280\n        Size Image        : 1382400\n        Colorspace        : sRGB\n        Transfer Function : Default (maps to sRGB)\n        YCbCr/HSV Encoding: Default (maps to ITU-R 601)\n        Quantization      : Default (maps to Limited Range)\n        Flags             :\n\n$ v4l2-ctl -d /dev/video0 --list-formats-ext\nioctl: VIDIOC_ENUM_FMT\n        Type: Video Capture\n\n        [0]: 'YU12' (Planar YUV 4:2:0)\n                Size: Discrete 1280x720\n                        Interval: Discrete 0.033s (30.000 fps)\n```\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4974443065/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4979134530","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119851#issuecomment-4979134530","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119851","id":4979134530,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABKMeQQg","user":{"login":"pkowal1982","id":19764492,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NzY0NDky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19764492?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pkowal1982","html_url":"https://github.com/pkowal1982","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pkowal1982/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pkowal1982/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pkowal1982/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pkowal1982/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pkowal1982/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pkowal1982/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pkowal1982/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pkowal1982/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pkowal1982/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-15T09:38:59Z","updated_at":"2026-07-15T09:38:59Z","body":"Have you checked returned bytesperline value? Is it 1280?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4979134530/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4981321432","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119851#issuecomment-4981321432","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119851","id":4981321432,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABKOju2A","user":{"login":"shiena","id":1295639,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyOTU2Mzk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1295639?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena","html_url":"https://github.com/shiena","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-15T13:48:40Z","updated_at":"2026-07-15T13:48:40Z","body":"> What resolutions are supported? Could you also check to what value bytesperplane is set to?\n\n```\n$ v4l2-ctl -d /dev/video0 --list-formats-ext\nioctl: VIDIOC_ENUM_FMT\n        Type: Video Capture\n\n        [0]: 'YU12' (Planar YUV 4:2:0)\n                Size: Discrete 1280x720\n                        Interval: Discrete 0.033s (30.000 fps)\n```\n\nAs shown above, the only supported resolution is 1280x720. I also confirmed at runtime that `VIDIOC_S_FMT` returns `bytesperline = 1280` — equal to the width, so there is no row padding.\n\n> Is the problem on your setup caused by ignoring bytesperline setting?\n\nNo — since `bytesperline` is equal to the width, DroidCam works without the bytesperline handling. The corruption was caused solely by the missing YU12 decoder.\n\nSo in PR #119852, the fix for this issue is the new YUV420 / YVU420 decoder. It also honors bytesperline, but only for consistency with the other decoders and to be on the safe side for drivers that pad rows, as you suggested.\n\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4981321432/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]